    {
      "noteNumber": 4,
      "noteText": "If PHI conveys a first-allowable pick in 2028, PHI pick is 9-30, and PHI pick is third most favorable of (1) BKN 2028 first round pick, (2) NYK 2028 first round pick, (3) PHI 2028 first round pick, and (4) PHX 2028 first round pick, then (a) third most favorable of (i) BKN 2028 first round pick, (ii) NYK 2028 first round pick, (iii) PHI 2028 first round pick, and (iv) PHX 2028 first round pick; else if PHI conveys a first-allowable pick in 2028 and PHI pick is 9-30, then (b) second most favorable of (i) BKN 2028 first round pick, (ii) NYK 2028 first round pick, (iii) PHI 2028 first round pick, and (iv) PHX 2028 first round pick; else (c) none"
